  (text "JREC references and pad numbering were added during reconstruction.\nTop view: rows from top to bottom; odd numbers left, even numbers right.\nThese are 2 mm pitch headers. Confirm mating cable numbering physically.\nRECOVERED_* nets are copper-traced pass-through nets with no source name."
